<title>POLAND: Mostostal- Z Q2 net rises to PLN 2.9 mln.</title>
<headline>Mostostal- Z Q2 net rises to PLN 2.9 mln.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-08-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Mostostal Zabrze SA preliminary results for the second quarter of the year ending June 30, 1997.</p>
<p>(Figures in millions of zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p>						Q2 1997	Q2 1996</p>
<p>    operating profit		     2.16   vs    3.17</p>
<p>    pre-tax profit			 4.49   vs    3.04</p>
<p>    net profit			     2.85   vs    2.43</p>
<p>NOTE - full company name is: Mostostal Zabrze SA.</p>
<p>    net sales			     31.97   vs   49.78</p>
<p>    costs of sales			28.24   vs   49.98</p>
<p>    extraordinary profit		 0.01   vs    0.01</p>
<p>    income tax			     1.64   vs    0.61</p>
<p>    other taxes			    bd     vs    bd</p>
<p>    financial revenues		   3.43   vs   12.10</p>
<p>    financial costs			1.10   vs   12.24</p>
<p>    investment			     2.40   vs    1.97</p>
<p>						H1 1997	H1 1996</p>
<p>    operating profit		     5.11   vs    5.77</p>
<p>    pre-tax profit			 7.87   vs    5.20</p>
<p>    net profit			     5.08   vs    4.15</p>
<p>    net sales			     67.85   vs   99.70</p>
<p>    costs of sales			57.80   vs   86.78</p>
<p>    extraordinary profit		 0.01   vs    0.02</p>
<p>    income tax			     2.79   vs    1.05</p>
<p>    other taxes			    bd     vs    bd</p>
<p>    financial revenues		   4.65   vs   19.19</p>
<p>    financial costs			1.89   vs   19.78</p>
<p>    investment			     5.00   vs    3.12</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
